{"id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-four-valued-structure.md","title":"df four valued structure","display":"df four valued structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-four-valued-structure","aliases":["72-df-four-valued-structure"],"display":"df four valued structure","depends_on":["[[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]","[[72-df-four-valued-truth]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §§2.2.1–2.2.4, print644–646/PDF656–658","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition and structural monotonicity reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-four-valued-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-four-valued-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df four valued structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"26e8ed17356e430c\" href=\"?note=26e8ed17356e430c\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-syntax\">72-df-logic-program-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0572b6bbfb593e05\" href=\"?note=0572b6bbfb593e05\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-truth\">72-df-four-valued-truth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §§2.2.1–2.2.4, print644–646/PDF656–658"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition and structural monotonicity reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>语言和公式如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"26e8ed17356e430c\" href=\"?note=26e8ed17356e430c\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-syntax\">72-df-logic-program-syntax</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^n\">\\(\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(D\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>；每个常数c解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c^M\\in D\">\\(c^M\\in D\\)</span>，函数f解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^M:D^{a_F(f)}\\to D\">\\(f^M:D^{a_F(f)}\\to D\\)</span>；关系R解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^M:D^{a_R(R)}\\to\\mathsf{Four}\">\\(R^M:D^{a_R(R)}\\to\\mathsf{Four}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to D\">\\(s:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to D\\)</span> 为赋值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M:=\\langle D,(c^M)_{c\\in C},(f^M)_{f\\in F},(R^M)_{R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}}\\rangle\">\\(M:=\\langle D,(c^M)_{c\\in C},(f^M)_{f\\in F},(R^M)_{R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}}\\rangle\\)</span>；字段按给定Σ各元数输入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(t)\\)</span> 为通常项递归；其式见下。等号按D的真实身份解释，负等式取互补。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\sqsubseteq N\">\\(M\\sqsubseteq N\\)</span> 只比较同一个D与同一组函数/常数解释的结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(x)&amp;:=s(x),\\quad\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(c):=c^M,\\quad\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(f(\\vec t)):=f^M(\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(\\vec t)&amp;:=(\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(t_i))_{i&lt;n}\\quad(\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^n),\\\\\n⟦ R(\\vec t)⟧_{M,s}&amp;:=R^M(\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(\\vec t)),\\quad⟦\\overline R(\\vec t)⟧_{M,s}:=\\sim R^M(\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(\\vec t)),\\\\\n⟦ t\\doteq u⟧_{M,s}&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf t,&amp;\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(t)=\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(u),\\\\\\mathsf f,&amp;\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(t)\\ne\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(u),\\end{cases}\\quad⟦ t\\ne u⟧_{M,s}:=\\sim⟦ t\\doteq u⟧_{M,s},\\\\\n⟦\\top⟧_{M,s}&amp;:=\\mathsf t,\\quad⟦\\bot⟧_{M,s}:=\\mathsf f,\\\\\n⟦ A\\circ B⟧_{M,s}&amp;:=⟦ A⟧_{M,s}\\mathbin{\\circ_4}⟦ B⟧_{M,s}\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}),\\\\\n⟦\\exists xA⟧_{M,s}&amp;:=\\bigvee^4_{d\\in D}⟦ A⟧_{M,s[x\\mapsto d]},\\quad⟦\\forall xA⟧_{M,s}:=\\bigwedge^4_{d\\in D}⟦ A⟧_{M,s[x\\mapsto d]},\\\\\nM\\sqsubseteq N&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\ \\forall\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\\ (R^M(\\vec d)\\sqsubseteq R^N(\\vec d)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(x)&amp;:=s(x),\\quad\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(c):=c^M,\\quad\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(f(\\vec t)):=f^M(\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(\\vec t)&amp;:=(\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(t_i))_{i&lt;n}\\quad(\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^n),\\\\\n⟦ R(\\vec t)⟧_{M,s}&amp;:=R^M(\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(\\vec t)),\\quad⟦\\overline R(\\vec t)⟧_{M,s}:=\\sim R^M(\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(\\vec t)),\\\\\n⟦ t\\doteq u⟧_{M,s}&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf t,&amp;\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(t)=\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(u),\\\\\\mathsf f,&amp;\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(t)\\ne\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(u),\\end{cases}\\quad⟦ t\\ne u⟧_{M,s}:=\\sim⟦ t\\doteq u⟧_{M,s},\\\\\n⟦\\top⟧_{M,s}&amp;:=\\mathsf t,\\quad⟦\\bot⟧_{M,s}:=\\mathsf f,\\\\\n⟦ A\\circ B⟧_{M,s}&amp;:=⟦ A⟧_{M,s}\\mathbin{\\circ_4}⟦ B⟧_{M,s}\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}),\\\\\n⟦\\exists xA⟧_{M,s}&amp;:=\\bigvee^4_{d\\in D}⟦ A⟧_{M,s[x\\mapsto d]},\\quad⟦\\forall xA⟧_{M,s}:=\\bigwedge^4_{d\\in D}⟦ A⟧_{M,s[x\\mapsto d]},\\\\\nM\\sqsubseteq N&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\ \\forall\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\\ (R^M(\\vec d)\\sqsubseteq R^N(\\vec d)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书IX§2.2.1–2.2.4逐式核对。按公式结构归纳，每个逻辑操作的信息单调性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\sqsubseteq N\\Rightarrow⟦ A⟧_{M,s}\\sqsubseteq⟦ A⟧_{N,s}\">\\(M\\sqsubseteq N\\Rightarrow⟦ A⟧_{M,s}\\sqsubseteq⟦ A⟧_{N,s}\\)</span>。签名、数元组、变量赋值都显式固定；量词不是在语法项上枚举，而是在D上取相应逻辑min/max。Herbrand特例取D为闭项集、函数解释为项构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-logic-program-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"26e8ed17356e430c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-four-valued-truth","status":"resolved","id":"0572b6bbfb593e05","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-four-valued-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-logic-program-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"26e8ed17356e430c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语言和公式如 [[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]，$t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$，$\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^n$，$n\\in\\omega$。$D\\ne\\varnothing$；每个常数c解释为 $c^M\\in D$，函数f解释为 $f^M:D^{a_F(f)}\\to D$；关系R解释为 $R^M:D^{a_R(R)}\\to\\mathsf{Four}$。$s:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to D$ 为赋值。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"D\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"c^M\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"f^M:D^{a_F(f)}\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"R^M:D^{a_R(R)}\\to\\mathsf{Four}","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"M:=\\langle D,(c^M)_{c\\in C},(f^M)_{f\\in F},(R^M)_{R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"M\\sqsubseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(x)&:=s(x),\\quad\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(c):=c^M,\\quad\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(f(\\vec t)):=f^M(\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(\\vec t)&:=(\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(t_i))_{i<n}\\quad(\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^n),\\\\\n⟦ R(\\vec t)⟧_{M,s}&:=R^M(\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(\\vec t)),\\quad⟦\\overline R(\\vec t)⟧_{M,s}:=\\sim R^M(\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(\\vec t)),\\\\\n⟦ t\\doteq u⟧_{M,s}&:=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf t,&\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(t)=\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(u),\\\\\\mathsf f,&\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(t)\\ne\\operatorname{val}_{M,s}(u),\\end{cases}\\quad⟦ t\\ne u⟧_{M,s}:=\\sim⟦ t\\doteq u⟧_{M,s},\\\\\n⟦\\top⟧_{M,s}&:=\\mathsf t,\\quad⟦\\bot⟧_{M,s}:=\\mathsf f,\\\\\n⟦ A\\circ B⟧_{M,s}&:=⟦ A⟧_{M,s}\\mathbin{\\circ_4}⟦ B⟧_{M,s}\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}),\\\\\n⟦\\exists xA⟧_{M,s}&:=\\bigvee^4_{d\\in D}⟦ A⟧_{M,s[x\\mapsto d]},\\quad⟦\\forall xA⟧_{M,s}:=\\bigwedge^4_{d\\in D}⟦ A⟧_{M,s[x\\mapsto d]},\\\\\nM\\sqsubseteq N&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\ \\forall\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\\ (R^M(\\vec d)\\sqsubseteq R^N(\\vec d)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"M\\sqsubseteq N\\Rightarrow⟦ A⟧_{M,s}\\sqsubseteq⟦ A⟧_{N,s}","display":false}],"bytes":2806,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-270","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-four-valued-structure|df four valued structure]]"},{"id":"2d49b9fae2b96976","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$、$V=\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}$、$\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$ 和四值结构取 [[72-df-four-valued-structure]] 的接口；语法等号 $=$ 与对象公式构造子 $\\doteq$ 分开。$n\\in\\omega$，$E=\\langle(a_i,b_i):i<n\\rangle$ 为有限项对序列；$c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$，$A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma$。空合取为 $\\top$，空析取为 $\\bot$。"},{"id":"6c4d010edfaaea6b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c472b2ba86057172","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-four-valued-structure]] 的 $\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$、$\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}$、非空域 $D$、项和 LP 公式。将Σ中每个R替成同元数互异 $R^+,R^-$，得到 $\\Sigma^\\pm$。$M$ 是论域为 $D$ 的四值结构；$N$ 遍历与 $M$ 有相同D与项解释的二值 $\\Sigma^\\pm$ 结构，$s\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}$。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-270","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-four-valued-structure|df four valued structure]]"}],"outgoing":["26e8ed17356e430c","0572b6bbfb593e05"]}